  "releaseNotes": "## Patch notes for 153.2.193\n\nThese patch notes summarize the changes from version 152.0.138.\n\nAdded 2 new endpoints:\n* Project.ReopenProjectStatus\n* Tag.DeleteTag\n\nChanges to data models:\n* ProjectMemberDto: Added new field `projectId`\n* TagUpdateDto: Added new field `name`\n* WorkSpaceUserInfoDto: Added new field `workspaceCulture`\n* WorkSpaceUserInfoDto: Added new field `workspaceCurrencyCulture`\n* WorkSpaceUserInfoDto: Removed field `workSpaceCulture`\n* WorkSpaceUserInfoDto: Removed field `workSpaceCurrencyCulture`\n\nDeprecated 1 old endpoints:\n* Project.RestoreProject",
